{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation","kind":"remark","title":"Truncation depth needed for free-neutron $\\beta$-decay at 1 ppb","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms","tags":["q-beta","truncation","comparison-with-measurement"],"text":"categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation\"></a><p>This remark records the truncation depth that <a href=\"#prop:categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms\" data-at=\"mass-endomorphism/hecke-chi-closed-forms-chi-per-irrep\">Mechanism 1</a> gives for free-neutron <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-decay at the substrate value <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code>.</p>\n<p>For free-neutron <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-decay, truncation at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N = 3</code> suffices for 1 ppb precision. Physical predictions rely on this finite truncation, not the formal infinite product.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation.md","heading":"Remark","number":"11.6.9","page":"b/rem-categorical-chain-convergence-mechanisms-neutron-truncation"}
